LANGUAGE.md, DEEPENING.md, and INTERFACE-DESIGN.md in this directory are copied byte-identical
(verified via `git hash-object`) from skills/engineering/improve-codebase-architecture/ in
https://github.com/mattpocock/skills @ commit 7afa86d3a5dd96edde06ffa014e16c64e733681e.

CONTEXT-FORMAT.md and ADR-FORMAT.md are copied byte-identical from
skills/engineering/grill-with-docs/ in the same repo and commit — their content is unchanged,
only their location moved (from a sibling `grill-with-docs/` folder into this one).

SKILL.md is copied from the same commit with exactly two edits: the two relative links to the
files above were updated from `../grill-with-docs/CONTEXT-FORMAT.md` and
`../grill-with-docs/ADR-FORMAT.md` to same-directory paths (`CONTEXT-FORMAT.md`,
`ADR-FORMAT.md`), since this port flattens both source skills into one folder. No other line
was changed — it still references Claude Code's built-in `Explore` subagent type as upstream
does, left as-is intentionally rather than remapped to this repo's own `researcher` agent, to
keep the port as close to verbatim as the link fix allows.
